格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Illusion-Agent: Where fantasy meets functionality — an AI agent platform for terminal, browser, any model, any OS.","id":"gh:1202726483","install_available":false,"language":"Python","name":"illusion-agent","slug":"YunTaiHua/illusion-agent","topics":["agent","ai","claude","claude-code","codex","deepseek","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","gemini","glm","gpt","hermes","hermes-agent","kimi","mimo","minimax","openai","openclaw","opencode","python"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Illusion-Agent: Where fantasy meets functionality — an AI agent platform for terminal, browser, any "},{"id":"p1s2","text":": Where fantasy meets functionality — an AI agent platform for terminal, browser, any model, any OS."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# IllusionAgent"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"[](https://pypi.org/project/illusion-agent/)   [](https://github.com/YunTaiHua/illusion-agent)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"*Where fantasy meets functionality. The best of many worlds, refined into one intelligent agent.*"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"中文版 | English"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## 📖 Introduction"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"IllusionAgent is an open-source AI agent platform. It unifies a multi-provider\nLLM gateway, a biling"},{"id":"p7s2","text":"ual (Chinese/English) CLI, a browser-based Web UI, and\na flexible extension ecosystem into a single "},{"id":"p7s3","text":"intelligent agent — at home\non Windows, macOS, and Linux."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"Whether you prefer the discipline of the terminal or the ease of the browser,\nIllusionAgent resonate"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"s with your workflow: a rich built-in toolset, specialized\nsub-agents, two compaction methods, MCP s"},{"id":"p8s3","text":"erver support, hooks, plugins, and\na cron scheduler for unattended automation — spanning Feishu, WeC"},{"id":"p8s4","text":"t, hooks, plugins, and\na cron scheduler for unattended automation — spanning Feishu, WeChat, and QQ."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"> Standing on the shoulders of giants — Claude Code prompts, OpenHarness\n> architecture, OpenClaw sc"},{"id":"p9s2","text":"heduling, kimi-cli infrastructure, hermes-agent\n> channels, cc-switch routing."},{"id":"p10s1","text":"### Core Features"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"- 🤖 **Multi AI Provider Support** - Anthropic, OpenAI, Copilot, Codex, and any compatible endpoint\n-"},{"id":"p11s2","text":" 🧠 **Multi-Agent Collaboration** - Built-in specialized agents (general-purpose, explore, verificati"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"on)\n- 🛠️ **Rich Toolset** - Full base + channel toolset + MCP dynamic tool extension\n- 📦 **Context C"},{"id":"p11s4","text":"ompaction** - Microcompact (clear old tool results) + full compaction (LLM summary), auto-triggered "},{"id":"p11s5","text":"as context fills\n- 🌐 **Web UI Interface** - Browser-based chat interface with `illusion web`, indepe"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"ndently usable alongside the terminal\n- 🌍 **Bilingual Interface** - Chinese/English auto-switch via "},{"id":"p11s7","text":"`ui_language` setting\n- 📝 **Comprehensive Markdown Rendering** - Tables, code blocks, rich text\n- 🔌 "},{"id":"p11s8","text":"**Flexible Extension System** - Plugins, hooks, skills, MCP servers\n- 🌐 **Built-in Browser** - Agent"},{"id":"p11s9","text":"-drivable browser with live view (desktop) or screenshot stream (web), ARIA snapshots, ref-based int"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"eraction, responsive viewport, element picking\n- 🔐 **Comprehensive Permission Control** - Three mode"},{"id":"p11s11","text":"s + fine-grained rules\n- 🎯 **Reasoning Effort Control** - low/medium/high/xhigh/max levels\n- 🪟 **Dee"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"p Windows Optimization** - Auto-detect Git, PowerShell support\n- 🖥️ **Zero Terminal Flicker** - Stab"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"le rendering based on Ink Static component\n- 📦 **Desktop Edition** - Electron shell with bundled Pyt"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"hon/Node.js, installers for Windows/macOS/Linux, zero environment setup, in-app auto-update"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"### Interface Preview"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"Welcome screen & rich text rendering"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"Demo video"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"📺 Watch demo on YouTube"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"## 🚀 Quick Start"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"### Requirements"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Python >= 3.10\n- Supports Windows, macOS, Linux\n- Node.js 18+ (only for source install; `pip insta"},{"id":"p18s2","text":"ll illusion-agent` does not require Node.js)"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"### Installation"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"### Desktop Edition"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"Prefer a desktop app without installing Python or Node.js? Download the installer\nfor your platform "},{"id":"p22s2","text":"— it bundles everything, zero environment setup:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"| Platform | Download |"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"| Windows | `IllusionAgent-Setup-<version>.exe` (NSIS installer) |\n| macOS | `IllusionAgent-<version"},{"id":"p24s2","text":">-arm64.dmg` |\n| Linux | `IllusionAgent-<version>-amd64.deb` or `IllusionAgent-<version>-x86_64.AppI"},{"id":"p24s3","text":".dmg` |\n| Linux | `IllusionAgent-<version>-amd64.deb` or `IllusionAgent-<version>-x86_64.AppImage` |"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"👉 Download from GitHub Release"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The desktop edition bundles Python 3.12 and Node.js 24 runtimes internally.\nSee Desktop Edition docs"},{"id":"p26s2","text":"dition bundles Python 3.12 and Node.js 24 runtimes internally.\nSee Desktop Edition docs for details."},{"id":"p27s1","text":"### Basic Usage"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"### Print Mode Notes"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"`-p` / `--print` runs a single non-interactive request and exits:"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"Important details:"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"- The prompt value must be the **last argument** because typer parses `-p` greedily.\n- In default pe"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"rmission mode, mutating tools exit with code **2** and persist a pending approval; answer it with `i"},{"id":"p33s3","text":"llusion -c -p \"Y\"`, `\"F\"`, or `\"N\"`.\n- Exit codes: `0` success, `1` error, `2` waiting for cross-tur"},{"id":"p33s4","text":"-c -p \"Y\"`, `\"F\"`, or `\"N\"`.\n- Exit codes: `0` success, `1` error, `2` waiting for cross-turn input."},{"id":"p34s1","text":"### Interface Notes"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"The terminal (`illusion`) and Web UI (`illusion web`) are two independent, first-class interfaces. T"},{"id":"p35s2","text":"hey share the same backend runtime, settings, and session storage — use whichever fits your workflow"},{"id":"p35s3","text":"ey share the same backend runtime, settings, and session storage — use whichever fits your workflow."},{"id":"p36s1","text":"## 📚 Detailed Documentation"},{"id":"p37s1","text":"| Topic | English | 中文 |"},{"id":"p38s1","text":"| Introduction | docs/en/introduction.md | docs/zh-CN/introduction.md |\n| Getting Started | docs/en/"},{"id":"p38s2","text":"getting-started.md | docs/zh-CN/getting-started.md |\n| Commands | docs/en/commands.md | docs/zh-CN/c"},{"id":"p38s3","text":"ommands.md |\n| Goal (Auto-Continuation) | docs/en/goal.md | docs/zh-CN/goal.md |\n| Settings & Creden"},{"id":"p38s4","text":"tials | docs/en/settings.md | docs/zh-CN/settings.md |\n| Project Files & Memory | docs/en/project-fi"},{"id":"p38s5","text":"les.md | docs/zh-CN/project-files.md |\n| Extensions (MCP, Plugins, Skills, Hooks) | docs/en/extensio"},{"id":"p38s6","text":"ns.md | docs/zh-CN/extensions.md |\n| Architecture | docs/en/architecture.md | docs/zh-CN/architectur"},{"id":"p38s7","text":"e.md |\n| Web UI Security | docs/en/security.md | docs/zh-CN/security.md |\n| Token Metering & Compact"},{"id":"p38s8","text":"ion | docs/en/token-metering.md | docs/zh-CN/token-metering.md |\n| Messaging Channels | docs/en/chan"},{"id":"p38s9","text":"nels.md | docs/zh-CN/channels.md |\n| @ Mentions (Skills / Sessions / Files) | docs/en/mentions.md | "},{"id":"p38s10","text":"docs/zh-CN/mentions.md |\n| Desktop Edition | docs/en/desktop.md | docs/zh-CN/desktop.md |\n| Built-in"},{"id":"p38s11","text":" Browser (browser-use) | docs/en/browser.md | docs/zh-CN/browser.md |"},{"id":"p39s1","text":"## 📄 License"},{"id":"p40s1","text":"This project is open-sourced under the MIT license."},{"id":"p41s1","text":"## 🤝 Contributing"},{"id":"p42s1","text":"Welcome to submit Issues and Pull Requests!"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
